        <tr>
          <td><span class="postbody">I can now craft heavy leather from 5 medium leathers.
<br />

<br />
 That means I can also make heavy armor kits (+24 to armor for chest, legs, hands, or feet) and I'll distribute these to y'all when I can
<br />

<br />
I'll make you guys heavy leather when I can and mail or give it to you. Let me know if you have a particular need at some point and we can go 'leathering' and/or 'meating' in the wetlands. The Mottled Raptors are a great source of medium leather and medium hide, and in the excavation site the mottled razormaw and scytheclaws are a good source of heavy leather. Also, the ogres there drop a lot of silk.
<br />

<br />
I also need heavy leather for most of the stuff I can make that I get skillpoints for now. I'm also now starting to need Spider Silk, and some potions (like minor agility / defense etc) to make some of the nicer items (like some gloves that increase lockpicking abilities etc)
<br />

<br />
My BIGGEST need these days seems to be medium and heavy hide.</span><span class="gensmall"><i></i></span></td>
